@k.words.ahem.noun.1 k.words.sense word=ahem pos=noun n=1 gloss="the utterance of a sound similar to clearing the throat; intended to get attention, express hesitancy, fill a pause, hide embarrassment, warn a friend, etc." synonym=hem is_a=utterance core.source="wordnet 3.1"
